## What This Repo Is

This is the official records repository for {{ org_name }} (EIN: {{ ein }}), a 501(c)(3) nonprofit corporation incorporated in {{ state }}{% if charter_no %} (Charter No. {{ charter_no }}){% endif %}. The `main` branch is the current, authoritative, board-approved state of the institutional record.

## Governance Model

- No direct pushes to `main`. Every change that reaches `main` must arrive through {{ mr_article }} {{ mr_term }} with the required board or officer approvals.
- Governance documents are written in present tense and final operative wording on the branch. Merge is the activation event; there is no later rewrite from future tense to present tense.
- {{ mr_term | capitalize }} approval is the electronic board vote or officer approval.
- The {{ mr_term }} description is the motion or resolution wrapper for the package being approved.
- {{ mr_term | capitalize }} comments are the discussion and review record.
- The merge commit on `main` is the authoritative adoption and effective timestamp.
- Git history is the source of truth for adoption timing. Inline approval dates are optional unless a specific law, regulator, or form requires them.

See `GOVERNANCE.md` for the full model.

## Approval Tiers

| Branch Prefix | Required Approvals | Use Cases |
|---------------|-------------------|-----------|
| `board/` | Directors then serving at the applicable quorum or supermajority threshold (this organization's configured rule: **{{ board_quorum_rule }}**) | Policies, bylaws, resolutions, elections |
| `admin/` | 1 officer with authority over the record | Minutes, financial reports, tax filings, correspondence |

